{
  "manifest_version": 2,
  "id": "github.cateye.filter-assistant",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "name": "不要只说不干",
  "description": "修复 DeepSeek V4 flash（测试时使用的提供方含 Command Code、阿里云百炼）Planner 工具调用失败问题（详见 https://github.com/Mai-with-u/MaiBot/issues/2017 ）：在 Planner 构造发送给 LLM 的请求体之前，自动过滤掉 messages/Context Items 中所有 role 为 assistant 的纯文本消息（仅保留 system、user、tool 角色），消除「不调用工具」坏示例对模型的污染。支持配置开关 strip_assistant_messages（默认开启）与 strip_reasoning_messages（默认关闭），仅影响临时请求体，不回写聊天历史。如果你发现 planner 决策声明回复而没有任何 reply 的调用，可以尝试使用该插件解决。",
  "author": {
    "name": "cateye",
    "url": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki"
  },
  "license": "MIT",
  "urls": {
    "repository": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_filter_assistant",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_filter_assistant",
    "documentation": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_filter_assistant/blob/main/README.md",
    "issues": "https://github.com/cateyemizuki/cateye_filter_assistant/issues"
  },
  "host_application": {
    "min_version": "1.0.0",
    "max_version": "1.99.99"
  },
  "sdk": {
    "min_version": "2.0.0",
    "max_version": "2.99.99"
  },
  "dependencies": [],
  "plugin_type": "tool",
  "display": {
    "icon": {
      "type": "lucide",
      "value": "eraser"
    }
  },
  "capabilities": [],
  "i18n": {
    "default_locale": "zh-CN",
    "supported_locales": [
      "zh-CN"
    ]
  }
}
